documents is referred in this request. The operator seems to have provided all the required documents"}]},{"name":"Application Due Diligence Review","criticality":"Critical","items":[{"title":"Share Ledger Certification","tag":"Share Ledger","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-08-18","description":"The share ledger submitted is uncertified. Resubmit duly certified.","notes":"11 Aug 2025: Dear RCL Team, See below feedback. The company seems to have submitted a certified copy of the document. Please review and update this item. Customer Reply: A certified share register has been uploaded"},{"title":"Business Plan","tag":"Business Plan","criticality":"Critical","due":"2024-08-06","description":"The organisational structure shows the UBO as a director of the company and also responsible KYC/AML. The UBO and AML roles are conflicting. Another compliance officer, fluent in AML, is required to be appointed and to submit their personal history and disclosure form.","notes":null},{"title":"Source of Funds of Business","tag":"Source of Funds","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-08-18","description":"The SOF document submitted is invalid. Kindly resubmit an updated SOF document with updated details of the applicant company and the UBO.Also please submit any loan agreements or financial agreements in the event of a shortfall in funds.","notes":"11 Aug 2025: Dear RCL, Please check if the documents provided by the applicant is sufficient. Customer Reply: A loan agreement between the UBO (Oksana Ponomarenko) and the company (Kromstex) has been submitted. RCL: An uncertified loan agreement for Eur 100,000 has been submitted. No FS/documentati0on in the event of a shortfall in funds has been provided. In LC on SOF/W applicant has provided an explanatory note on this. The SLA should be certified. Otherwise this CL can be closed."},{"title":"Compliance Officer","tag":"Operations","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-08-18","description":"The compliance officer is representing a number of other entities. Please advise how he will be overlooking such operations.","notes":"Dear RCL Team, The company seems to have appointed a new CCO. Please review and get back to the company. Customer Reply Dear Sirs, Many businesses outsource specific duties to specialized businesses. We would like to let you know that the Gaming Companies have outsourced the compliance services to Mr. Sergey Volf who is the Chief of Compliance of the outsourced company. As a result, Mr. Sergey Volf is the head of the Compliance Team, which in turn manages the compliance operations for numerous online casinos. Furthermore, an amended version of the business plan has been uploaded for your review."},{"title":"AML policy","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-08-18","description":"AML Policy relates to EU law this must be updated to reflect Curacao Obligations.","notes":"11 Aug 2025: Dear RCL Team, Please review the AML Policy provided by the company and update the item! Customer Reply Dear Sirs, The client has received the new AML regulation of Curacao just recently and are diligently amending their policies to reflect these accordingly."},{"title":"Sanctioned Countries","tag":"Player Account","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-08-18","description":"Registration allows for sanctioned countries together with no age verification. Please advise how players are verified.","notes":"Dear RCL Team, Please check if the respond from the company is sufficient and update the item! Customer Reply Dear Sirs, When registering, both the date of both and country (and personal address) are required KM 18/11 response sufficient and verified online.,"},{"title":"Financial Statements","tag":"Financial Audit","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-21","description":"Submit financial statements for year ending 2023.","notes":"11 Aug 2025: Dear RCL, Please review the financial Statement provided by the company! Customer Reply: Financial statements have been uploaded RCL: Clarify. FS are not uploaded on portal RCL Note 17/11/2025: FS 2024 uploaded but not signed. Checklist re-opened."},{"title":"QPA/2024/02751 - Inna Honcharuk - CV","tag":"Curiculum Vitae","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-22","description":"Please upload the CV for the compliance officer.","notes":null}]}]}]}